                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi κ
                    %mo =
                    %mn 0
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \kappa = 0
              is trivial.
            %p
              It will be convenient to introduce some notation. For
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
